        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n\n    actor User\n    participant UI as React Frontend\n    participant API as Spring Boot API\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL\n    participant NLP as Python NLP Service\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;UI: Select branch and upload CSV\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: POST /import-jobs\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Create import job (queued)\n\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Job ID\n\n    API--&gt;&gt;UI: 202 Accepted + Job ID\n\n    Note over API,DB: Background processing begins\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Update job status (running)\n\n    Note over API,DB: Validate and deduplicate CSV rows\n\n    loop For each valid review\n\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save review\n\n        API-&gt;&gt;NLP: Analyze review text\n\n        NLP--&gt;&gt;API: Aspects and sentiment labels\n\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save analysis results\n\n    end\n\n    Note over API,DB: Record rejected rows separately\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Update final job status\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: GET /import-jobs/{id}\n\n    API--&gt;&gt;UI: Status and processing summary\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;UI: Open analytics dashboard\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: GET /analytics\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Retrieve aggregated results\n\n    DB--&gt;&gt;API: Analytics data\n\n    API--&gt;&gt;UI: Dashboard response&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="7DK4qO3AIx3xMXfaSw6L-1">
